n zijn moeilijk te verdragen. Wanneer ze zijn telefoon belt om nog één keer zijn stem te horen, neemt hij onverwacht op. Hun onverklaarbare contact geeft haar een nieuwe kans om afscheid te nemen, maar maakt loslaten ook moeilijker. Julie moet bepalen wat deze tijdelijke verbinding betekent voor haarzelf en voor de andere mensen die Sam missen.","work_id":987139008,"evidence":[{"note":"DustinThao YouveReachedSam2021, Julie/Sam plot, exact Dutch HalloMetSam9789021467979. Not sequelYouveFoundOliver and no factual claim that phones connect deceased people.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p435656155"],"reference":"work:499","checked_at":"2026-11-03T08:16:03.676Z","supplemental":null,"existingAlternativeReview":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-016.json","sources":["https://openlibrary.org/works/OL24457490W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p435656155"]},{"note":"Exact bounded bulk source did not provide a verified asset; reuse unchanged resolver and inspect actual front or neutral placeholder hosted. No arbitrary image or absent-book claim.","type":"no_verified_cover_asset_retained","isbn13":"9789021467979","status":"no_verified_asset_retained","attempts":[{"status":"bulk_archive_unavailable","coverId":15139137,"receipt":"cover-archive-v2-readback.json","receiptSha256":"8529a8efea33798915ea378cecc82a7765e1800b8ec34536875c4a996d541fc7"}],"checkedAt":"2026-11-03T08:16:03.677Z","editionKey":"/books/OL46528670M","limitation":"No verified image is imported. Existing neutral placeholder; not proof that no cover exists at the provider or elsewhere."}],"language":"nl","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","source_url":"https://openlibrary.org/works/OL24457490W","reviewed_at":"2026-11-03T08:16:03.676+00:00","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_type":"official_catalog","review_batch":"nl-scale-20261102-040","review_status":"approved","bou