"open_library_edition_id":"OL25426216M"},"seq":30,"relation":"editions","after_row":{"id":987239029,"title":"Portret van een dame","isbn_10":null,"isbn_13":"9789077895092","work_id":987139005,"cover_id":null,"language":"dut","publisher":"Just Publishers","publish_date":null,"open_library_edition_id":"OL25426216M"},"before_row":null},{"key":{"work_id":987139005,"language":"nl"},"seq":31,"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","after_row":{"text":"De jonge Amerikaanse Isabel Archer komt naar Europa met de wens haar eigen leven vorm te geven. De wereld waarin ze terechtkomt biedt haar mogelijkheden, maar stelt ook verwachtingen over huwelijk en positie. Nieuwe vrijheid maakt haar keuzes niet vanzelf eenvoudig. Achter aandacht en goede raad kunnen andere belangen schuilgaan. Henry James volgt hoe Isabel probeert zelfstandig te blijven terwijl persoonlijke verlangens en sociale druk steeds nauwer met elkaar verweven raken.","work_id":987139005,"evidence":[{"note":"HenryJames PortraitOfALady1881, Dutch9789077895092 translates the1908revisedtext perKB; keep same existing Work, not film. Version provenance explicit, no new duplicate Work.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p304748560"],"reference":"work:419","checked_at":"2026-11-03T08:16:03.676Z","supplemental":null,"existingAlternativeReview":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-018.json","sources":["https://www.penguin.co.uk/books/60378/the-portrait-of-a-lady-by-henry-james-ed--philip-horne/9780141441269","https://penguinrandomhouselibrary.com/book/?isbn=9780141441269","https://openlibrary.org/works/OL276365W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p304748560"]},{"note":"Exact bounded bulk source did not provide a verified asset; reuse unchanged resolver and inspect actual front or neutral placeholder hosted. No arbitrary image or absent-book claim.","type":"no_verified_cover_asset_retained","isbn13":"9789077895092","status":"no_