ork zonder veel vertrouwen in grote liefdesverhalen. Haar dagelijkse metrorit krijgt een andere betekenis wanneer ze Jane ontmoet. De aantrekkingskracht is duidelijk, maar aan Jane blijkt iets onmogelijk: zij is vanuit de jaren zeventig in deze tijd terechtgekomen. August probeert te begrijpen wat haar vasthoudt en hoe ze kan helpen. Daardoor moet ze ook opnieuw kijken naar haar eigen verleden en naar haar overtuiging dat alleen leven de veiligste keuze is.","work_id":987139003,"evidence":[{"note":"CaseyMcQuiston OneLastStop2021 August/JaneNewYorksubway story, exact Dutch DeLaatsteHalte9789020542585; not another train romance orEnglish edition.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p432191569"],"reference":"work:295","checked_at":"2026-11-03T08:16:03.676Z","supplemental":null,"existingAlternativeReview":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-018.json","sources":["https://openlibrary.org/works/OL21703286W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p432191569"]},{"note":"Exact bounded bulk source did not provide a verified asset; reuse unchanged resolver and inspect actual front or neutral placeholder hosted. No arbitrary image or absent-book claim.","type":"no_verified_cover_asset_retained","isbn13":"9789020542585","status":"no_verified_asset_retained","attempts":[{"status":"bulk_archive_unavailable","coverId":15165837,"receipt":"cover-archive-v2-readback.json","receiptSha256":"8529a8efea33798915ea378cecc82a7765e1800b8ec34536875c4a996d541fc7"}],"checkedAt":"2026-11-03T08:16:03.677Z","editionKey":"/books/OL61200456M","limitation":"No verified image is imported. Existing neutral placeholder; not proof that no cover exists at the provider or elsewhere."}],"language":"nl","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","source_url":"https://openlibrary.org/works/OL21703286W","reviewed_at":"2026-11-03T08:16:03.676+00:00","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_ty