":null,"language":"dut","publisher":"The House of Books","publish_date":null,"open_library_edition_id":"OL60309759M"},"before_row":null},{"key":{"work_id":987139015,"language":"nl"},"seq":50,"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","after_row":{"text":"Literair agent Nora Stephens laat haar werk meestal voorgaan, maar stemt in met een reis met haar zus Libby. Die hoopt in Sunshine Falls een ander soort avontuur te beleven dan hun gewone leven biedt. Nora ontmoet er onverwacht Charlie Lastra, een redacteur met wie ze eerder in New York botste. Hun herhaalde ontmoetingen maken haar vakantie minder overzichtelijk. Tussen de verwachtingen van haar zus, haar loopbaan en haar eigen gevoelens moet Nora bepalen welk verhaal ze zelf wil volgen.","work_id":987139015,"evidence":[{"note":"EmilyHenry BookLovers2022 Nora/Libby/Charlie, exactDutch9789044366365. English-looking title staysDutch by exactedition language, not guessed fromtitle.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p441950078"],"reference":"work:774","checked_at":"2026-11-03T08:16:03.676Z","supplemental":null,"existingAlternativeReview":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-018.json","sources":["https://openlibrary.org/works/OL24801992W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p441950078"]},{"note":"Exact bounded bulk source did not provide a verified asset; reuse unchanged resolver and inspect actual front or neutral placeholder hosted. No arbitrary image or absent-book claim.","type":"no_verified_cover_asset_retained","isbn13":"9789044366365","status":"no_verified_asset_retained","attempts":[{"status":"bulk_archive_unavailable","coverId":15127877,"receipt":"cover-archive-v2-readback.json","receiptSha256":"8529a8efea33798915ea378cecc82a7765e1800b8ec34536875c4a996d541fc7"}],"checkedAt":"2026-11-03T08:16:03.677Z","editionKey":"/books/OL60309759M","limitation":"No verified image is imported. Existing neutral placeholder; not proof th